  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.21: PDF non-BMP text-layer fix. #77: supplementary-plane symbols (via the Symbola fallback) now emit their ToUnicode mapping as a UTF-16BE surrogate pair (e.g. U+1F6C7 -> <D83DDEC7>) instead of a truncated raw codepoint, so copy/paste, search, and text extraction return the correct character. BMP glyphs are unaffected. See CHANGELOG.md.",
